# Python and tooling
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.streamlit/secrets.toml
logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SICKLE LABELS stay out of git (2026-10-14). The SICKLE dataset is shared
# only through its authors' access form and carries no licence, so no file
# holding per-field labels, or values derived field by field from them, is
# committed. They stay on disk; reproduce.sh regenerates all of them after
# you obtain data access (set SICKLE_DATA_ROOT, see sickle-project/.env.example).
#   results/features.csv              per field-season features with yield
#   results/predictions/              per-field predictions, histories, references
#   results/console/*.html            embeds a below-threshold flag per field-season
#   results/workflow/*.sqlite         simulated findings drawn from the labels
# Aggregate metrics (results/metrics/*.json) and figures are committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/results/features.csv
/results/predictions/
/results/console/*.html
/results/workflow/*.sqlite
